new method : Space optimization:---

Code_____:

>>>  class solution{
        public int ClimbingStairs(int n){
          int prev1=1;
          int prev2=1;

          for(int i = 2;i<=n;i++){
            curr = prev1+prev2;
            prev2 = prev1;
            prev1 = curr;
          }
          return prev1;
        }
}
